atterns/20260805-source-that-ships-without-reinstalling-the-binary-the-hooks-call-is-inert.md — Source that ships without reinstalling the binary the hooks call is inert\n- docs/knowledge/patterns/20260714-a-fail-open-host-swallows-fail-closed-throws.md — A fail-open host swallows fail-closed throws into an allow\n- docs/knowledge/patterns/20260821-a-faked-seam-hides-the-parse.md — A faked seam hides the parse\n\nExpertise — dispatcher-picked; read/load before implementing:\n- /home/thanhsmind/Projects/goglbe/beehive--wt--codex-parity-completion/.agents/skills/bee-writing-skills/SKILL.md — required for runtime reference edit; existing RED baseline in feature CREATION-LOG.md and MAIN mailbox job-1789223547597-1113273-1 (B/B/A), no exception needed; leader owns GREEN dispatch after your source update. Read it to full.\n- /home/thanhsmind/Projects/goglbe/beehive--wt--codex-parity-completion/.agents/skills/bee-technical-writing/SKILL.md — document mode first, plain STE and unslop; preserve frozen headings and protocol vocabulary. Read it to full.\n- /home/thanhsmind/Projects/goglbe/beehive--wt--codex-parity-completion/docs/history/codex-parity-completion/reports/cpc-1.md — accepted installed-hook evidence, not guesses; observed collaborationspawn_agent has opaque message; source alias now selects guard and denies, no decryption. Actual persisted parent Stop wait mark in .bee/state.json, child completion must not mark parent idle. Read it to full.\n- /home/thanhsmind/Projects/goglbe/beehive--wt--codex-parity-completion/docs/history/codex-parity-completion/reports/cpc-2-recovery.md — accepted commit a8f94c0f, 452 Linux tests, 8 ignored; actual prepared readonly CLI command/stdin proves read/patch/shell/continuation denials and unchanged bytes. Null slot economics unverified. Native 0.154.0 cell requests refused because opaque input, explicit configured transports stay available. Escalation preserves parent model and refuses unsupported route. Windows execution NOT proven;