    25	## Driving it with control-bee
    26	
    27	Preconditions:
    28	
    29	- A launched sandbox, `bash .bee/verify/verify-app/control-bee doctor` fully `ok`.
    30	- An isolated private `CODEX_HOME` directory. Never use or alter real user credentials.
    31	- Set `TMPDIR=/var/tmp`.
    32	- Direct `CODEX_BIN="$(mise which codex)"` and `BEE_BIN="$(bash .bee/verify/verify-app/control-bee bin)"`.
    33	- The repository is onboarded with Codex hooks present in `.codex/hooks.json`.
